      "created_at": "2015-03-15T06:12:43.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Just curious what people's strategies for different villains so I figure start out with the baron blade scenarios. What powers do you use and everything.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For the first one. my main thing I try and do is teleport as much as much as possible to try and avoid attacks. This strategy though doesn't work well when everyone else is using long range attacks.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>havent played 2-3 as much due to the nature of the scenarios so don't have as much of a strategy yet.</p>",
